SUMMARY:Bob Marley - Live at the Rainbow Theatre Film Screening
DESCRIPTION:REDUCE FOMO! Click here for guaranteed admission and RSVP!\nhttps://wl.eventim.us/event/bob-marley-live-at-the-rainbow-theatre/704439?afflky=Getitrightthefirsttime \nGet It Right Music in association with BK One Productions is proud to present our late summer/early fall music documentary and horror film movies (yes\, those two things go together\, and yes\, we ARE wondering why you are asking!). Watch fan favorites on our 16-foot wide LED video wall and enjoy the film in full concert sound! \nYou have reached the ticketing page for Bob Marley – Live at the Rainbow Theatre! An electric performance featuring one of the few documented Bob Marley shows! \nA 1977 performance by Bob Marley at London’s Rainbow Theatre\, filmed shortly after the release of his album Exodus. Accompanied by backing band the Wailers\, he performs well-known tracks including No Woman No Cry\, Exodus\, No More Trouble and Trenchtown Rock. \nEvent Info \nFilm: Bob Marley – Live at the Rainbow Theatre \nDate: October 1st\, 2026 \nDoors: 7pm\nScreening: 730pm \nRSVP: Free or strongly encourage guaranteed $20 two-drink included RSVP. \nAddress: Industry City Bandshell Stage\, Courtyard 1/2 at Industry City in Brooklyn\, New York between 36th and 37th street and 2nd and 3rd Avenues. \nENTER 238 36th Street\, Brooklyn\, NY on your GPS device \nThe selection of music documentaries was curated by audience vote from our summer concert series and the horror movies came from out of our brains! \nSeating for these screenings are limited to 150 people or so (with slightly more for the music docs so peeps can throw down appropriately. \nFans who purchase the 2 drink guaranteed RSVP will be guaranteed entry\, natch! So you will save money at the bar\, AND make sure you aren’t shut out! \nThis event is free with RSVP\, ages 8 and up are welcome. There will be drink specials\, all night\, as well. \nLimited seating (about 100-125 seats)\, tons of standing room. No strollers. \nNo outside beverages. There will be drink specials all night long from our courtyard bar. \nWhile we do our best to gauge the number of RSVPs\, entry is still on a first-come\, first-served basis\, so please arrive early! Once we hit capacity\, we will only let people in on an in and out basis! Fans who purchase the 2 drink RSVP at check-out will be guaranteed entry! \nThe venue is located in an open-air courtyard featuring a full concert sound stage. Fans can get affordable drinks from the venue’s bar and order food from over 17 options inside the adjoining food hall. \nHow to get here:\nTake the D\, N\, R lines to 36th street station in Brooklyn and walk west one block to Industry City. 3 stops from Manhattan. 30 minutes from Herald Square. \nFrom Long Island\, take the LIRR to Atlantic Terminal then take the D\, N or R train to 36th street.
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/bob-marley-live-at-the-rainbow-theatre-film-screening/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/marley.jpg
END:VEVENT
