SUMMARY:The Helm Family Ramble Band Return to Industry City
DESCRIPTION:Get tickets here: https://wl.eventim.us/event/the-helm-family-ramble-band-return-to-industry-city/693384?afflky=Getitrightthefirsttime \nIndustry City and Get It Right Music in association with Murmrr Presents are proud to welcome The Helm Family Ramble Band in their return to Industry City. Enjoy a brilliant evening of music featuring selections from the Band’s catalog as well as a rock n’ roll revue celebrating the iconic songbook of Levon Helm and the canon of American roots music. \nEvent Info \nDate: October 1\, 2026 \nDoors: 7pm \nSet 1: 7:45pm \nSet 2: 9:00pm \nTickets: $50 per person plus fees in advance/$60 day of show \nAddress: Industry City Bandshell Stage\, Courtyard 1/2 at Industry City in Brooklyn New York between 36th and 37th street and 2nd and 3rd Avenues. \nENTER 238 36th Street\, Brooklyn\, NY on your GPS device \nThe venue is located in an open-air courtyard featuring a full concert sound stage. Fans can get affordable drinks from the venue’s bar and order food from over 17 options inside the adjoining food hall. Concert is rain or shine. \nHow to get here: \nTake the D\, N\, R lines to 36th street station in Brooklyn and walk west one block to Industry City. 3 stops from Manhattan. 30 minutes from Herald Square. \nFrom Long Island\, take the LIRR to Atlantic Terminal then take the D\, N or R train to 36th street. \nMore About The Helm Family Ramble Band \nIn the heart of Woodstock\, NY\, cradled by the shadow of Overlook Mountain\, the \nHelm Family Ramble is guided by Levon Helm’s daughter\, Amy Helm\, the Ramble has continued its evolution. Amy is honoring her father’s vision for both Levon Helm Studios and The Midnight Ramble by creating a community of musicians that crosses generational and musical lines. Calling together an extended family of musicians and special guests\, the Helm Family Ramble invites the audience into a singular musical experience\, threading the ties of the past into the present.
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/the-helm-family-ramble-band-return-to-industry-city/
CATEGORIES:Live Events,Ticketed Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Helm-Family.jpg
END:VEVENT
