SUMMARY:Self-Care Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Makko Ho (真向法) is a traditional Japanese self-care stretching practice combining gentle movement\, breathing\, and body awareness to support flexibility\, relaxation\, and overall well-being. \nLed by Kumiko Kanayama\, Founder & Director of Five Lights Center of Shiatsu. \nNo experience or special flexibility is needed. Come stretch\, breathe\, and experience Japanese wellness culture in Brooklyn!
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/self-care-workshop/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Workshop.jpg
