SUMMARY:El Souq: NYC's Swana & South Asian Marketplace
DESCRIPTION:El Souq makes its Brooklyn debut at Industry City with a one-day celebration of independent SWANA and South Asian brands\, creativity\, music\, food\, and community. \nDiscover 50+ emerging designers\, makers\, artists\, and small businesses across fashion\, jewelry\, home\, art\, beauty\, food and more—all brought together in El Souq’s signature marketplace-meets-gathering-space experience. \nCome to shop\, stay for the music. The day features sounds by 360 Record Shop and headliner DJ Mansaf Mama\, alongside interactive experiences and activations designed to bring people together. \nA new borough. Same El Souq energy. Like no other.
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/el-souq-nycs-swana-south-asian-marketplace/
