SUMMARY:CiderFeast Brooklyn
DESCRIPTION:The CiderFeast™ East Coast Tour lands in Brooklyn at Industry City on Saturday\, October 3\, for an all-inclusive celebration of everything hard cider and all the delicious foods that go with it. \nCiderFeast Brooklyn brings together the region’s best cideries and perfectly pairs pours of hard cider with outstanding bites from neighborhood favorites. \nThis year’s lineup features nationally recognized ciders as well as producers whose work is rooted in the region’s distinctive fruit and terroir\, including: \n1911 Established\nAtomic Dog Ciders\nAval Cider\nEden Ciders\nFrosty Twig Cider\nIndian Ladder Farms Cidery & Brewery\nLong View Cider\nNine Pin Cider Works\nOccam Fine Cider\nOrchard Hill Cider Mill at Soons\nOriginal Sin Cider\nQuartz Rock Cider House\nStone Ridge Orchard\nTreasury Cider\nVermont Cider Co. and Woodchuck Cider\nWayside Cider\nand more \nDiscover cider’s remarkable range with outstanding bites. Cider’s nuances shine with food pairings\, whether you’re trying something sweet or savory. Taste how complex flavors emerge when you try a sip of cider with nibbles from favorite local restaurants\, chefs\, and hot sauces like Achilles Heat Smoked Chili Crisp.
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/ciderfeast-brooklyn/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IC.png
END:VEVENT
