SUMMARY:Family Program: Printmaking Play with Gelli Plates
DESCRIPTION:This all-ages workshop will introduce children and families to the fundamentals of printmaking through Gelli plate monoprinting. Participants will explore accessible printing using botanicals\, found materials\, and everyday objects to create unique one-of-a-kind prints. The workshop encourages experimentation and creative play while providing an accessible introduction to the printmaking process for all ages.
URL:https://industrycity.com/event/family-program-printmaking-play-with-gelli-plates/
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://industrycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Lindsey_Jones_Family-1-copy.png
