SUMMARY:Dried Flower Resin Craft Workshop: Hosted by little bloomtale × KAJIHA
DESCRIPTION:Join our Resin Craft Accessary Workshop by little bloomtale hosted by Kajiha! \nDiscover the art of resin crafting and make your own beautiful jewelry pieces filled with our dried flowers.\nIn this hands-on\, relaxing workshop\, you’ll design and create your very own resin accessories—now with even more options to choose from\, including necklaces\, earrings\, bracelets\, and keychains (with more to come).\n• All materials provided\n• Perfect for beginners and craft lovers alike\n• Take home your own handmade accessory \nLet your creativity bloom and craft something truly special with us!
