SUMMARY:Handmade Stationery Block Printing
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, participants will learn the fundamentals of relief printmaking by carving their own lino printing block and creating a personalized stationery set. Participants will design\, carve\, and print their own imagery onto cards and envelopes. A selection of pre-carved blocks will also be available\, allowing participants to combine personal designs with existing imagery and explore the possibilities of shared printmaking tools. \nMaterials Included
